{"version":1,"content":"<p>Xbox CEO 阿莎·夏爾馬表示，Xbox Series主機的銷量「仍受到供應限制」，該部門「正在努力將更多主機送到玩家手中」。微軟發佈的2027財年第一季度財報顯示，Xbox內容與服務收入同比下降2%，Xbox硬件收入同比下降14%。財報發佈後，夏爾馬在社交媒體上強調，Xbox的「責任利潤率」已經「改善」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584328.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.201874+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:12:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.544138+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.544138+00:00","content_hash":"2363091de6441ef6c251949a45fe954e8c3ceab355b0e9860a62663e5081b980","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}